font-size: 12pt'> 36 weeks</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21367]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>-</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>increased </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Interval between ECV and birth \u2013    chances of C/S</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"be8da3ce7bac2e6fbe889f63\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure be8da3ce7bac2e6fbe889f63\" viewbox=\"1724025 142875 228600 285750\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"f1cebc6938527ebdb766bd17bf865c2eac8d4a6dfc73896678f45c45e6e3a101\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-6fc0074ed5258a44a422\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"6fc0074ed5258a44a422\" transform=\"translate(1846407 227965)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(0 63660.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -63660.5)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 127321\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-6fc0074ed5258a44a422)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21368]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>-</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>9% patient decline ECV<