\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(0 63500) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -63500)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 127000\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-b19e4302664d1839f039)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21374]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">207.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Tocolysis</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> with </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Betamimetics</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> (0.25mg Terbutaline) or 250ug salbutamol in 25ml saline I/V x slow</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ly</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"7154e85914af387e921f78c8\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-029\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 7154e85914af387e921f78c8\" viewbox=\"1028700 -47625 209550 542925\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"f189d7a05d2fc85a0b015485f69b81a49fe3ea2f9f5b5b3adad4b84afb1a6436\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-7b3056918f8844be5920\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"7b3056918f8844be5920\" transform=\"translate(1116957 5120)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 11575 387752\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-7b3056918f8844be5920)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21376]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21377]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not effective in </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u03b2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> blocker us</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ers</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21378]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(no role of </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>nifedipine</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> &amp; atosiban)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21379]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Indication of tocolysis:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21380]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. Routinely</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21381]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. Tense abdomen</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21382]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Unsuccessful ECV without tocolysis.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21383]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">208.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prophylactic anti \u2013 D </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>in</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> D</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>-ve </sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>women.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21384]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">209.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Regional/ </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neuraxial</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>anaesthesia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> not recommended</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>routinely</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> used in repeat attempt or when women don\u2019t tolerate</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21385]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Unstable lie:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> ECV + stabilizing induction</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21386]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Contraindication</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> of ECV</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21387]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">210.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Reasons for C/S</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21388]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Previa</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21389]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Distress</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21390]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">211.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Multiple pregnancy</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21391]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">212.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abruption</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21392]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">213.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Severe PE</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21393]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">214.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abnormal Doppler</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21394]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">215.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding &lt; 1 week</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21395]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">216.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PROM</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21396]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">217.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mother declines</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21397]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">218.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Myomectomy</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21398]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Electronic fetal monitoring is recommended after ECV</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21399]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Testing for </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fetomaternal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> haemorrhage is recommended</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21400]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Up to 4 attempts in 10 min</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21401]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Caution:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21402]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">219.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Previous C/S</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21403]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">220.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Polyhydramnios</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21404]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class